# AdTech Logic: Real-Time Bidding (RTB) & Auction Engine
# Purpose: Handle sub-millisecond decision making for incoming ad requests.
# Includes Frequency Capping (don't show ad too often) and Budget Pacing.

# ==========================================
# 1. Frequency Capping
# ==========================================
# Requirement: User U-123 should see Campaign C-999 max 3 times per hour.

# Key: freq:C-999:U-123:<hour_timestamp>
# Val: count

INCR freq:C-999:U-123:2024121010
EXPIRE freq:C-999:U-123:2024121010 3600 # Expire after 1 hour

# Check in logic:
# count = GET freq:C-999:U-123:2024121010
# IF count >= 3 THEN DO_NOT_BID

# ==========================================
# 2. Budget Pacing (Token Bucket)
# ==========================================
# Requirement: Campaign C-999 has $1000/day. We want to spend it evenly.
# "Fast pacing" spends it all in the morning. "Smooth pacing" spreads it out.
# Redis key stores remaining budget for the current minute/hour.

# Debit budget for a successful bid ($1.50 CPM -> $0.0015 per impression)
DECRBYFLOAT budget:C-999:remaining_today 0.0015

# Atomic check before bidding
# If returns negative, we overspent -> Logic should catch this or handle rollback
# Better: generic "avail_check"
GET budget:C-999:remaining_today
# If val < 0.0015 THEN PAUSE_BIDDING

# ==========================================
# 3. Geo Targeting (GeoSpatial)
# ==========================================
# Purpose: Find campaigns targeting specific locations efficiently.

# Store Campaigns by tailored Geo-Sets
# e.g. "campaigns targeting NY"
SADD targeting:geo:US:NY "C-999" "C-888"

# Or use GEO commands for "Hyper-local" ads (e.g. coffee shop)
# Add active local campaigns
GEOADD ads:local_campaigns -74.0060 40.7128 "C-Local-Coffee"

# User is at lat/lon. Find ads within 1km.
GEORADIUS ads:local_campaigns -74.0060 40.7128 1 km
# Returns ["C-Local-Coffee"] -> Eligible to bid.

# ==========================================
# 4. Bid Request Cache
# ==========================================
# Store the raw bid request for potential "win" notification correlation (short TTL)
SETEX bid_req:req_abc_123 300 "{\"device\": \"iphone\", \"app\": \"flappy_bird\", ...}"
